{"4448200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coffee Raccoons", "steam_appid": 4448200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Coffee Raccoon</strong>, you step into the paws of a raccoon barista running your very own intergalactic café by day, and traveling to distant planets by night in search of rare ingredients. The game features a cozy, scrap-punk aesthetic inside your café, while your nightly journeys take you across lush, dreamlike alien worlds filled with unique plants and quirky alien species designed to inspire a sense of wonder and joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/3db3c37825fb870fa8530ad681404410.avif?t=1786540254\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/11ed9334cf0e671fe5aa2402c3f20df8.poster.avif?t=1786540254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/11ed9334cf0e671fe5aa2402c3f20df8.webm?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/11ed9334cf0e671fe5aa2402c3f20df8.mp4?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play solo or team up</strong> with a friend or a loved one and run your intergalactic café side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/c10e23bd7855131cfec58fcb5120ccaa.avif?t=1786540254\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/f434b80d52824a8d0d2a8a5d828c8dbc.poster.avif?t=1786540254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/f434b80d52824a8d0d2a8a5d828c8dbc.webm?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/f434b80d52824a8d0d2a8a5d828c8dbc.mp4?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel to distant planets and <strong>explore diverse biomes</strong> filled with unusual alien beans, strange sweeteners, and <strong>rare cosmic ingredients</strong> waiting to be discovered. <strong>Scavenge scrap</strong> from the remains of fallen civilizations and carefully <strong>manage your oxygen</strong> as you venture across vibrant, unpredictable landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/bd16a93d7d5951b55fffdf0d1521247a.avif?t=1786540254\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/9a12be9b4289144372d137260f7c4d80.poster.avif?t=1786540254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/9a12be9b4289144372d137260f7c4d80.webm?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/9a12be9b4289144372d137260f7c4d80.mp4?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with <strong>newly discovered recipes</strong> and <strong>design strategic menus</strong> that match customer preferences while making the most of your resources. Every choice matters; what you serve shapes your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/31786702cd3298ba4ba003dc4a92500d.avif?t=1786540254\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/408bc5f9194673a4ef1db5bba95635d7.poster.avif?t=1786540254\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/408bc5f9194673a4ef1db5bba95635d7.webm?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn money from your café and collect scrap to <strong>unlock powerful upgrades</strong>. Improve your brewing machinery, enhance your gathering gear, or upgrade your ship to travel even farther into space. Each upgrade opens new possibilities, ingredients, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/2f6ec3518c956fd29d0ef4f986faea5b.avif?t=1786540254\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/1f79907fc394ff9349bf363e360cd188.poster.avif?t=1786540254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/1f79907fc394ff9349bf363e360cd188.webm?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/1f79907fc394ff9349bf363e360cd188.mp4?t=1786540254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Prepare orders</strong> quickly while <strong>handling the unpredictable side effects</strong> of exotic beans that might warp time, trigger teleportation mishaps, or produce other wacky side effects. Keep an eye on your <strong>stress level </strong>and don’t burn out! And if you do, a little rummaging through the trash can cure burnout. After all, you are just a raccoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Coffee Raccoon</strong>, you step into the paws of a raccoon barista running your very own intergalactic café by day, and traveling to distant planets by night in search of rare ingredients. The game features a cozy, scrap-punk aesthetic inside your café, while your nightly journeys take you across lush, dreamlike alien worlds filled with unique plants and quirky alien species designed to inspire a sense of wonder and joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/extras/3db3c37825fb870fa8530ad681404410.avif?t=1786540254\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video