e on your <strong>stress level </strong>and don’t burn out! And if you do, a little rummaging through the trash can cure burnout. After all, you are just a raccoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Run your intergalactic brewing business as you explore alien worlds in search of rare ingredients. Upgrade your machines, unlock quirky space gear, and journey to distant planets to discover new flavors. Craft irresistible menus and grow your café into a legendary coffee destination among the stars!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/0439e2354c79802e72b7ac2ca745bdeef62621ad/header.jpg?t=1786540254", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/d65324750a45dba8ec79923656174542adf2e301/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786540254", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448200/d65324750a45dba8ec79923656174542adf2e301/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786540254", "website": "https://coffeeraccoon-newsletter.subscribepage.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (4 GB) / AMD Radeon RX 5500 XT (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\